{"pageid": 501, "title": "James", "revid": 1896, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "LGBTQIA+", "Children", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">James</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/James.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130201814\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"James\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/James.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241130201814\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/James.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241130201814 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/James.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241130201814 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"James\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\" data-image-key=\"James.png\" data-image-name=\"James.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> <small>(formerly)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James%27_father\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"James&#39; father\">Unnamed father</a><br /><p>Unnamed mother<br />Unnamed sister<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>James</b> is a young boy from <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a>, who was a survivor of an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a> attack. The only one to escape from his sleepover group, James was traumatized by the death of his friends by a monster he had thought he'd made up. Upon <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>'s arrival, James began to assist her in tracking down and killing the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Oscuratype Monster</span> and its <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">children</span>. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Early_life\">Early life</span></h3>\n<p>James's parents were divorced, and he primarily lived with his father and sister in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a>. His father is often at field hockey events with his sister.\n</p><p>James is gay, and faces homophobia from several classmates, notably <a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Brisby\" title=\"Dan Brisby\">Dan Brisby</a>, who calls him a \"pervert.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> James also had a major crush on <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>, which he talked about to his friends <a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a> at sleepovers;<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> this was a  recent development, as he hadn't had \"sleepover friends\" for very long.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> His friends encouraged James to ask him out, before they attempted to sneak out of the house. They were caught and got in trouble for this. When James asked Karl out, Karl told him that they should remain platonic. However, he did join the friend group.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak_incident\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak_incident\">Archer's Peak incident</span></h3>\n<p>While alone in a dark room of the house, James imagined a creepy face with long arms outside the window, and scared himself so much he ran to his room. He then told Tyler at their next sleepover, and the story spread far enough to create an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype monster</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC14&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC14-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>At a sleepover with <a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>, James chooses \"truth\" in a game of Truth or Dare. He tells a story about hearing a noise in the ravine while home alone, and turning out the lights to look outside, before describing a long-fingered monster emerging from the woods. Noah disbelieves him, so James dares him to go look for himself.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> All four boys snuck out of the house to check under the bridge for the monster. Noah spots it first, just as James trips and falls down the hill. He hears his friends scream.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> He runs up the hill to see the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">monster</span> violently kill his friends. Before it kills him, however, his father arrives, causing it to leave. Terrified, James cries that this was his fault.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>James was soon picked up by the police, where he recounted the incident, but did not describe the monster, fearing he wouldn't be believed. Due to the media attention, James and his family temporarily moved to a hotel room.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Two weeks following the murders, James was confronted by Dan at a memorial set up for the missing children outside the school. Dan accused him of doing the murders, causing James to shout at him to \"shut the fuck up.\" He was sent to the principal's office, but <a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal John Collins</a> was sympathetic and let him return to class. After school, James returned to the hotel, only to meet <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> in the parking lot. She informed him that she would believe anything he said, and prompted him to describe the monster he saw. He realizes that she is a monster hunter, and asks if he can assist her in killing it.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\">Issue #3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #13</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\">Issue #14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">Issue #15</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3ab35ebf3060a5555b417f2dfdcd928b\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"James1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:75px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:James1.png\" title=\"James1.png (949 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:75px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/61/James1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20241214180511\" title=\"James1.png (949 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #1\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"James1.png\" data-image-key=\"James1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Issue #1\"